The option to reserve an iPhone Duo for Apple Store pickup is starting to return on Apple's online store, with the system live again in countries such as <a href="https://www.apple.com/au/shop/buy-iphone/iphone-duo">Australia</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/cn/shop/buy-iphone/iphone-duo">China</a>, <a href="https://www.apple.com/jp/shop/buy-iphone/iphone-duo">Japan</a>, and <a href="https://www.apple.com/kr/shop/buy-iphone/iphone-duo">South Korea</a>. Unfortunately, our spot check revealed extremely limited availability right now, with few to no time slots available for all configurations.<br/>
<br/>
